<title>MOROCCO: Morocco to import 600,000T Iraqi crude by end 1997.</title>
<headline>Morocco to import 600,000T Iraqi crude by end 1997.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's main oil refinery Samir will import 600,000 tonnes of Iraqi crude oil indexed on Brent prices by end 1997, a Moroccan energy official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We received the green light to import 600,000 tonnes of crude oil from Iraq. The oil purchase will take place by stages from August until the end of December 1997,&quot; the official who declined to be named told Reuters.</p>
<p>He gave no details on loading dates.</p>
</text>
